# WINDOW FACTOR: window_factor_gib 3, from 2 on the cut before these ratios: at 2 GiB per window a scan of the cut solve on these ratios was refused (FS-SPARSE-DIRECT-FACTOR-BUDGET, a numeric payload of 2218291464 bytes), so the solve and the render ran at 3. It sets no sound.
window_factor_gib	3
window_budget_gib	64
# MODE CERTIFICATE: maximum_relative_halfwidth 1e-7, as on the E4 cards; origin's default certificate refused the 9-window plan for the cut before these ratios (FS-MODAL-HALFWIDTH-EXCEEDED), and this bar was not run at the default. At 1e-7 the widest certificate of the band's 9 modes is 2.3e-5 Hz, on the mode at 1244.515 Hz. It sets no sound.
maximum_relative_halfwidth	1e-7
# RECEIVER: the broadband observer (e6313e19d): one delay and an order-16 rational fit of the boundary-element transfer from each bar mode to the receiver, checked on held-out frequencies against a 5 % budget. It hears the bar during the mallet's contact and with its travel time; the narrow-band law it replaces passed the contact force as a pulse.
observer	broadband
observer_fit_order	16
observer_held_out_budget	0.05
observer_rigid_rows	on
